    "prompt": "When people walk in snow, the depth ($D$ cm) of each footprint depends on both the area ($A$ cm²) of the shoe sole and the weight of the person. The graph shows the relationship between the area of the shoe sole and the depth of the footprint for a group of people of the same weight.",
